WEBVTT

00:16.059 --> 00:19.059
This is the chaotic time
of spontaneous gangs.

00:19.768 --> 00:20.934
In order to scramble for territory...

00:21.684 --> 00:23.308
they are not afraidto purge each other...

00:23.309 --> 00:24.379
despite the rules.

00:26.643 --> 00:27.143
Butcher...

00:28.601 --> 00:29.101
slaughter...

00:30.934 --> 00:32.018
to survive.

00:33.976 --> 00:36.098
Until the formation of four forces.

00:38.252 --> 00:40.543
These four hold hundreds of juniors
under their command...

00:40.768 --> 00:43.059
creating a balance
in the underworld during the time.

00:45.202 --> 00:46.994
They are known as:

00:47.496 --> 00:48.238
Cuong...

00:48.426 --> 00:50.476
Area: Cho Lon - Weapon: chopper
Business: protection, loaning

00:50.518 --> 00:51.226
Hao...

00:51.317 --> 00:54.059
Area: Float Market - Weapon: scimitar
Business: protection, smuggling

00:54.351 --> 00:55.082
Chan...

00:55.145 --> 00:57.226
Area: Cau Muoi Market - Weapon: ice saw
Business: protection, restaurants

00:57.309 --> 00:57.903
Hung.

00:57.928 --> 00:59.976
Area: Night Market-Weapon: pig chopper knife
Business: smuggling, prostitute

01:00.248 --> 01:02.864
UNTIL ONE DAY...

01:08.893 --> 01:09.825
Slash him!

04:01.809 --> 04:03.059
Go on, driver!

04:03.601 --> 04:05.393
Okay, here we are.

04:10.184 --> 04:12.476
Come!

04:13.434 --> 04:14.184
Go on, driver!

04:14.185 --> 04:15.933
Excuse me sir, is it far from here
to the center of Saigon?

04:15.934 --> 04:17.184
Almost there!

04:18.101 --> 04:19.018
Sir, but…

04:23.772 --> 04:24.798
Go check on him.

04:27.393 --> 04:28.158
Are you okay?

04:28.768 --> 04:29.439
So high!

04:30.476 --> 04:33.252
Hey Ba, you bring the duck
to grill or what?

04:33.518 --> 04:34.351
You're crazy.

04:34.893 --> 04:36.025
Ut Det gave me the duck.

04:36.393 --> 04:40.041
She said we must always
stick together no matter what.

04:40.393 --> 04:41.095
She's harsh!

04:41.546 --> 04:42.869
You're the crazy one.

04:46.809 --> 04:48.393
Is this what Saigon smells like?

04:50.226 --> 04:50.931
God damn!

04:51.043 --> 04:51.627
Smells good?

04:52.059 --> 04:53.684
Damn you!

04:55.518 --> 04:56.808
How careless!

04:56.809 --> 04:57.736
Stop joking.

04:58.934 --> 05:00.080
- Y'all hungry.
- Yeah.

05:00.226 --> 05:00.736
Across the road.

05:04.143 --> 05:04.893
First come first serve!

05:06.934 --> 05:10.351
1 - TWO SIDES OF THE SAME COIN

05:11.476 --> 05:12.851
Sir, make me three bowls of noodle soup!

05:13.101 --> 05:14.059
Ok!

05:22.476 --> 05:23.851
Here, one bowl first.

05:24.351 --> 05:25.517
Why did you guys follow me?

05:25.601 --> 05:28.183
Jeez, who follows you?

05:28.184 --> 05:29.064
We go together because we're like-minded.

05:29.434 --> 05:31.851
The town's too small,
I could even hear you fart.

05:32.393 --> 05:33.643
You fled here
to make some money, didn't you?

05:34.351 --> 05:35.143
Fled what?

05:35.893 --> 05:37.933
I'm not even sure
if it's gonna bloom or doom.

05:37.934 --> 05:38.900
Who dared to invite y'all?

05:40.434 --> 05:42.101
Here, enjoy your meal!

05:42.226 --> 05:43.226
Thank you, sir. I Thank you.

05:43.934 --> 05:44.559
Sir!

05:44.976 --> 05:45.601
What's up?

05:45.601 --> 05:46.601
Are you hiring?

05:47.424 --> 05:49.851
I can barely feed myself,
let alone hire another one.

05:50.893 --> 05:51.976
Are you teasing me?

05:53.184 --> 05:54.726
You guys come from the countryside?

05:55.059 --> 05:55.588
That's right.

05:55.768 --> 05:56.299
Where?

05:56.726 --> 05:57.486
Ca Mau.

05:58.463 --> 05:59.579
Does it still have the “cape”?

05:59.809 --> 06:00.291
Yes, it does.

06:00.518 --> 06:01.759
I still remember it.
(It's a wordplay in Vietnamese)

06:05.309 --> 06:06.559
Make me 10 takeaway bowls of noodle soup.

06:06.643 --> 06:07.184
Here you go!

06:07.320 --> 06:09.237
Gosh, seems like a ready sale,
how come he doesn't hire any helpers?

06:09.684 --> 06:10.463
You shouldn't care.

06:11.143 --> 06:11.518
Just eat.

06:11.643 --> 06:12.111
Oh God!

06:17.643 --> 06:18.934
It hurts!

06:19.309 --> 06:21.350
No! Let go!

06:21.351 --> 06:22.025
Ba!

06:22.518 --> 06:23.076
Ba!

06:23.101 --> 06:24.184
My money is in there!

06:24.231 --> 06:25.606
Do not let go!

06:42.226 --> 06:42.768
Fuck You!

06:44.643 --> 06:45.541
Stop!

06:52.768 --> 06:53.720
Where did he go?

06:54.101 --> 06:54.580
This way.

06:56.434 --> 06:57.351
Oh my God, thieves.

07:00.309 --> 07:00.955
Long!

07:01.393 --> 07:01.851
What?

07:02.059 --> 07:03.768
- Is it the right way?
- Yes!

07:06.059 --> 07:06.726
- Ba!
- Ba!

07:08.726 --> 07:09.518
Go, guys, let's go!

07:09.684 --> 07:10.268
What's wrong?

07:10.643 --> 07:12.814
- I'm fine, let's go now.
- Wait, where's my bag?

07:13.184 --> 07:14.369
It's in there, but let it go…

07:14.893 --> 07:15.541
Where are they?

07:15.726 --> 07:16.658
They're also in there…

07:16.683 --> 07:18.475
Are you insane? All our money is in there!

07:18.809 --> 07:20.118
We're dead if we come back!

07:20.143 --> 07:20.601
Just go beat them!

07:20.602 --> 07:22.143
They have two, we have three,
nothing to fear.

07:22.451 --> 07:24.701
Phong, Long, listen to me!
Don't go in there!

07:24.726 --> 07:25.684
It's really terrifying!

07:25.851 --> 07:27.309
Gosh, I've been in there, I knew!

07:27.726 --> 07:29.142
Phong, Long, don't go in there!

07:29.143 --> 07:29.643
Where are they?

07:29.851 --> 07:31.143
I'mma beat them…

07:34.268 --> 07:37.476
See? I told you it's dangerous.

07:39.393 --> 07:40.059
Why didn't you tell us sooner?

07:40.143 --> 07:40.976
I already told you.

07:40.977 --> 07:42.127
But you should've been more specific!

07:42.152 --> 07:44.767
That is just your point of view,
look at mine…

07:47.726 --> 07:48.431
What now, Long?

07:49.143 --> 07:49.884
We're here anyways…

08:46.309 --> 08:47.377
Are you done?

08:51.809 --> 08:55.226
Thugs!

08:55.476 --> 08:57.559
I'm sorry, I didn't know this is your area.

09:00.059 --> 09:00.809
My bag!

09:10.726 --> 09:11.439
What's wrong?

09:13.268 --> 09:13.845
Let's go!

09:19.434 --> 09:19.768
Go!

09:19.893 --> 09:21.143
What about my Ut Det shorts?

09:21.184 --> 09:22.101
I'll explain later.

09:22.184 --> 09:23.393
My money is in there.

09:24.768 --> 09:26.059
Phong, are your arms okay?

09:26.643 --> 09:27.314
It's fine.

09:28.059 --> 09:29.851
How crazy of you to block the knife
with your bare hand.

09:29.934 --> 09:31.783
You should stop watching
those self-defense videos.

09:32.195 --> 09:34.111
I saved you, bastard!

09:35.309 --> 09:36.431
Where to go now?

09:37.194 --> 09:38.540
There's no bus at this hour.

09:39.887 --> 09:40.962
I don't know either.

09:47.601 --> 09:50.059
I think we should wait here...

09:50.393 --> 09:51.934
and see if there's any car
passing by to hitchhike.

09:52.143 --> 09:52.642
Okay.

09:59.059 --> 10:00.101
- Hey!
- What?

10:00.518 --> 10:02.101
Why did you stop me from chasing them?

10:03.101 --> 10:03.768
Are you nuts?

10:04.226 --> 10:05.424
This is their area.

10:06.184 --> 10:07.851
I think they're more than that.

10:08.934 --> 10:10.257
Would you rather lose money or die?

10:11.018 --> 10:13.976
But our money is all in there.
What to do now?

10:18.143 --> 10:19.206
We'll cross that bridge when we come to it.

10:21.809 --> 10:22.559
It sucks!

10:32.434 --> 10:33.143
Not yet, dude!

10:33.851 --> 10:34.639
You punk...

10:37.516 --> 10:38.077
Yo, there's a bus.

10:40.684 --> 10:41.476
Are you crazy?

10:42.518 --> 10:44.838
Sir, can we hitchhike to the center?

10:46.476 --> 10:47.101
They wanna hitchhike…

10:47.393 --> 10:48.034
Ok!

10:48.893 --> 10:49.434
Get on!

10:51.309 --> 10:51.643
Go!

10:53.711 --> 10:54.336
Thanks, bro.

10:54.851 --> 10:55.351
Thank you.

11:01.726 --> 11:05.559
Hey, it's this late
but they still gave us a lift. Awesome!

11:05.976 --> 11:07.559
- How lucky.
- Yeah. So lucky.

11:08.684 --> 11:09.661
It's crowded, isn't it?

11:10.393 --> 11:11.726
Hey, let me get to know them.

11:12.351 --> 11:13.393
Forget it, don't disturb them!

11:13.851 --> 11:14.768
It's okay!

11:17.268 --> 11:22.268
Sir, how far is it from here to the center?

11:22.559 --> 11:23.297
It's almost there.

11:24.518 --> 11:25.328
Is your arm injured?

11:26.518 --> 11:27.143
Here, bind it.

11:28.934 --> 11:29.434
Thank you, sir!

11:32.559 --> 11:34.893
Excuse me, sir, do you have a spare one?
May I borrow too?

11:36.011 --> 11:36.809
For what?

11:37.143 --> 11:39.893
I didn't warm up before the fight...

11:40.184 --> 11:41.309
I have two left.

11:41.643 --> 11:42.434
I have two left.

11:44.393 --> 11:45.018
Thank you, sir.

11:45.476 --> 11:47.601
Here, I'll give you one.
Bind whatever you want.

11:48.559 --> 11:49.518
What is there to bind?

11:50.059 --> 11:51.393
Sir, I don't have the need to use so…

11:51.893 --> 11:54.351
Oh, sir, you dropped the knife.

11:56.184 --> 11:56.934
Are you a chef?

11:57.893 --> 12:00.018
Could you recommend a job for us?

12:00.309 --> 12:01.559
We're from the countryside.

12:02.268 --> 12:06.058
If you're not careful with this,
it's gonna cut you bad.

12:06.059 --> 12:07.184
And there's gonna be blood everywhere and…

12:13.544 --> 12:14.150
Sir...

12:16.184 --> 12:17.446
use it carefully…

12:18.511 --> 12:19.434
Did I say something wrong?

12:19.476 --> 12:20.216
You're so annoying!

12:20.559 --> 12:21.643
It's late! Let them rest!

12:22.034 --> 12:23.992
Yeah, we should sleep too.

12:31.518 --> 12:32.476
Get off! Get off?

12:34.101 --> 12:36.059
Okay. Wait a sec… - Okay.

12:36.190 --> 12:37.041
We've arrived?

12:37.601 --> 12:38.101
Get off quick.

12:38.126 --> 12:38.751
What? What is it?

12:39.184 --> 12:40.101
Hey! Now that?

12:40.126 --> 12:41.970
What happened?

12:41.995 --> 12:43.287
Go, run.

12:45.268 --> 12:46.643
Wait, calm down.

12:51.813 --> 12:53.461
- What now?
- No idea.

12:58.739 --> 13:00.549
Hac Hung! You son of a bitch!

13:00.809 --> 13:02.538
It's Hai Cuong's area
and you dare to mess up?

13:26.121 --> 13:27.076
Go up!

13:31.893 --> 13:32.893
Phong!

13:48.243 --> 13:50.691
If my legs weren't hurt,
I would beat the hell out of them!

13:50.716 --> 13:52.765
If my hands weren't hurt,
I would punch them in the throat.

14:01.018 --> 14:02.893
Hey, let's go! Are you insane?

14:24.893 --> 14:26.068
Hey, you! Stop!

14:41.559 --> 14:42.225
You...

15:37.184 --> 15:38.268
That's enough!

15:39.684 --> 15:40.309
Back off!

15:52.079 --> 15:54.662
Hey. Why are we hiding here?

15:55.976 --> 15:57.823
Don't want to? Then go out there.

15:58.018 --> 16:00.309
Are you crazy?
They're gonna kill me.

16:00.504 --> 16:02.205
I think this is a very serious situation.

16:03.525 --> 16:04.967
Should we call the police?

16:05.018 --> 16:06.851
Yeah, that makes sense.

16:15.018 --> 16:16.767
We're saved!

16:16.768 --> 16:19.058
- Sir!
- Sir!

16:19.059 --> 16:20.557
- We have something to report.
- Yes.

16:21.768 --> 16:23.559
Sir, are you mistaken?

16:23.684 --> 16:27.393
We didn't do anything…
we only hitchhiked…

16:29.601 --> 16:31.864
Thank you sir.
I'm glad you guys came in time.

16:39.768 --> 16:43.893
Long say something!
It's not the right time to act cool.

16:46.309 --> 16:47.418
Why are you arresting us?

16:47.684 --> 16:49.541
- Explain at the police station.
- Sir!

16:56.601 --> 16:58.518
I remember I did pray before I left…

17:00.072 --> 17:02.655
Should we go back to our town?

17:04.268 --> 17:05.684
Not until I make enough money.

17:06.851 --> 17:07.476
Haven't made any money yet,

17:07.477 --> 17:08.726
but we've already got a criminal record.

17:10.851 --> 17:11.643
What are you looking at?

17:14.893 --> 17:15.851
Sir!

17:18.976 --> 17:20.351
Keep silent! Stop making noise here!

17:34.268 --> 17:35.851
Sir! They hit me!

17:39.768 --> 17:40.476
Hung!

17:50.309 --> 17:51.518
This is none of your business!

17:54.226 --> 17:56.999
It's because you messed with
my friend's girlfriend.

17:59.434 --> 18:01.040
How dare you touch Ut Det?

18:01.393 --> 18:02.184
Wanna fight?

18:04.268 --> 18:06.393
Attack!

19:22.018 --> 19:24.101
Damn it! We didn't know anything!

19:24.601 --> 19:25.559
We just hitchhiked.

19:25.851 --> 19:26.949
Didn't expect to come this far.

19:27.309 --> 19:28.498
Who's gonna look after your parents?

19:29.065 --> 19:30.202
And why did you come here?

19:30.662 --> 19:31.630
To make money.

19:32.038 --> 19:33.377
We can't make a living back in town.

19:33.518 --> 19:35.891
They even got sick from worrying too much.

19:37.726 --> 19:38.711
His father has kidney disease...

19:38.934 --> 19:39.868
he needs to run
kidney dialysis monthly...

19:39.893 --> 19:40.810
he's waiting for transplantation.

19:44.434 --> 19:45.434
His kidney is not
compatible with his dad's.

19:48.018 --> 19:50.351
For me, I'm making money to marry Ut Det.

19:51.143 --> 19:53.226
Mine is hard to say…

19:53.251 --> 19:54.668
His mom has a gambling addiction.

19:55.559 --> 19:57.518
She even got famous
in the Western area for gambling.

19:57.684 --> 19:58.981
She's in deep debt.

20:00.309 --> 20:01.949
Shut up! Who asked you to tell that?

20:02.143 --> 20:02.851
Stop.

20:05.979 --> 20:06.950
How about you?

20:07.740 --> 20:09.577
What are you doing now?
Looks tough.

20:10.851 --> 20:11.601
I'm a policeman.

20:11.726 --> 20:12.143
The hell?

20:14.018 --> 20:14.634
What?

20:15.268 --> 20:16.143
Liar.

20:16.768 --> 20:17.851
Just between us here, be honest.

20:18.059 --> 20:18.601
Yeah.

20:18.809 --> 20:20.143
Holy moly!

20:20.809 --> 20:22.393
What kind of police
with such terrifying tattoos?

20:23.143 --> 20:23.767
It's true.

20:23.976 --> 20:24.768
I'm a policeman.

20:25.476 --> 20:26.684
I'll buy it only when pigs fly.

20:30.684 --> 20:31.476
Just kidding...

20:34.136 --> 20:34.932
I'm a fighter now.

20:35.143 --> 20:36.934
In the underworld.

20:38.893 --> 20:41.018
Wow, you're a gangster now?

20:41.376 --> 20:42.517
You're insane.

20:42.976 --> 20:44.559
Hey, gangsters must be rich, huh?

20:45.434 --> 20:46.768
Don't be crazy like me.

20:47.601 --> 20:49.684
Just find a stable job and settle down.

20:50.934 --> 20:52.059
As long as it makes money,
I wanna be crazy like that.

20:52.559 --> 20:53.268
- Me either.
- Right?

20:53.476 --> 20:54.268
What are you saying?

20:54.773 --> 20:56.190
Every coin has two opposite sides.

20:57.101 --> 20:58.682
It's how we use it that matters.

20:59.476 --> 21:01.679
Didn't know a gangster
could talk philosophically.

21:04.393 --> 21:05.934
But what exactly
are you guys going to do here?

21:06.351 --> 21:07.143
Waiter.

21:07.726 --> 21:09.101
Accommodation and meals included.

21:09.226 --> 21:09.976
Really good.

21:10.226 --> 21:10.768
When do you start?

21:12.309 --> 21:13.143
Right now.

21:13.643 --> 21:15.181
We made an appointment yesterday.

21:15.426 --> 21:16.672
We should go now.

21:17.018 --> 21:17.851
Let's go!

21:17.876 --> 21:18.654
Here's yours.

21:22.518 --> 21:24.101
We'll talk later tonight.

21:34.280 --> 21:34.854
Hey!

21:35.544 --> 21:36.466
Keep it to use.

21:38.572 --> 21:39.200
Thanks!

21:52.768 --> 21:54.143
Phong, help me catch the duck!

21:54.268 --> 21:55.934
Oh God!

22:27.237 --> 22:28.159
No one picked up.

22:28.902 --> 22:30.240
Damn. How could it be such bad luck?

22:35.676 --> 22:36.603
What are you doing, Ba?

22:37.787 --> 22:38.621
I'm saving it.

22:39.143 --> 22:40.684
I'll buy it when I'm rich.

22:40.851 --> 22:41.707
My ass!

22:45.945 --> 22:46.602
Let's go!

22:48.143 --> 22:50.226
I don't believe Saigon has no jobs for us.

22:51.559 --> 22:52.554
What about our accommodation?

22:55.934 --> 22:57.018
Let's go find one.

23:00.851 --> 23:02.726
I have a stomach ache, Long.

23:04.101 --> 23:04.934
Wifey!

23:05.726 --> 23:06.559
Where are you?

23:07.768 --> 23:08.934
Come home and cook some meals.

23:09.393 --> 23:14.393
See? The people here are very polite,
friendly and gentle.

23:14.809 --> 23:16.934
This area is a civilized neighborhood...

23:17.184 --> 23:19.351
every house is a civilized family.

23:27.476 --> 23:28.518
So what do you think?

23:29.851 --> 23:33.643
Well…I think it's okay,
but do we have another option?

23:34.851 --> 23:36.309
There's a homestay in the back.

23:36.559 --> 23:37.851
What is a homestay?

23:38.559 --> 23:40.601
It's a fully furnished apartment.

23:40.726 --> 23:41.767
You guys just need to come and stay,

23:41.768 --> 23:43.268
no need to bring anything else.

23:44.809 --> 23:45.476
Is it expensive?

23:45.934 --> 23:47.018
Very reasonable price.

23:47.601 --> 23:50.142
Including a pool, a park, benches…

23:50.143 --> 23:51.018
suitable for… - Sir.

23:51.184 --> 23:52.432
- What?
- It must be affordable.

23:52.485 --> 23:54.076
Because we're saving for our startup.

23:54.101 --> 23:55.684
Don't worry.
The price is really reasonable.

23:55.934 --> 23:58.601
Very suitable for young
creative people like you guys.

24:01.351 --> 24:02.893
There! Riverside view.

24:03.226 --> 24:04.203
Four fronts.

24:04.559 --> 24:05.934
Fully furnished.

24:06.559 --> 24:07.518
You just need to come and stay.

24:07.726 --> 24:09.268
That's how you should begin your startups!

24:12.476 --> 24:12.976
Is that okay?

24:13.934 --> 24:14.607
Are you good?

24:17.476 --> 24:18.559
Let's go check inside first.

24:18.726 --> 24:20.517
It's no different than the one at home.

24:20.518 --> 24:22.022
Why are you always…

24:22.268 --> 24:22.934
Stop it,

24:22.959 --> 24:24.209
we don't have enough money
for other places anyways.

24:36.559 --> 24:37.476
What are you doing...?

24:42.601 --> 24:43.393
What is that...?

24:45.518 --> 24:46.130
Sir…?

24:48.726 --> 24:51.559
Where is he? Where's the uncle?

24:52.476 --> 24:53.059
Sir!

24:55.226 --> 24:56.059
Hello?

24:56.143 --> 24:56.848
What?

24:57.559 --> 24:58.540
Homestay?

25:00.018 --> 25:01.184
It's booked now.

25:01.476 --> 25:03.018
I told you to call me sooner.

25:03.101 --> 25:03.566
Sir!

25:03.934 --> 25:05.351
Alright, next time okay?

25:05.476 --> 25:06.268
- Sir!
- What?

25:06.726 --> 25:08.768
There's a girl inside and a red altar.
It looks scary.

25:09.684 --> 25:11.684
Just a lovelorn girl.

25:12.184 --> 25:16.476
And the altar is for old people
who used to live there.

25:17.851 --> 25:18.726
Don't worry.

25:18.726 --> 25:19.601
There is no worship without sacredness,

25:19.601 --> 25:20.601
there is no taboo without luck.

25:22.143 --> 25:22.837
What?

25:23.351 --> 25:23.643
No.

25:23.726 --> 25:24.667
Decide quickly!

25:24.700 --> 25:26.326
I have to come home to cook for my wife.

25:26.351 --> 25:27.018
We won't rent it.

25:28.476 --> 25:29.351
Quickly!

25:30.101 --> 25:30.851
Yes, we'll take it.

25:31.393 --> 25:33.268
Really? Okay.

25:33.434 --> 25:34.934
Prepare 3 photos of you guys.

25:35.351 --> 25:36.568
Tomorrow I'll bring them to the temple...

25:36.893 --> 25:37.393
oops, I mean,

25:37.518 --> 25:38.934
to the police station for
temporary residence registration.

25:39.601 --> 25:41.226
Yes, I'm coming home, honey.

25:42.434 --> 25:43.391
What more do you ask for?

25:44.351 --> 25:46.059
There's no place cheaper than this.

25:47.018 --> 25:47.934
We're saving now.

25:58.893 --> 26:00.809
Hey you wench! I saw you!

26:01.559 --> 26:04.184
Stop right there! Hey!

26:04.226 --> 26:04.643
Hey, stop! Damn it,

26:04.644 --> 26:05.851
I haven't eaten anything since morning!
Stop running!

26:07.101 --> 26:07.768
Stop running!

26:10.643 --> 26:11.784
Such a civilized neighborhood.

26:11.809 --> 26:12.143
Oh.

26:16.143 --> 26:16.741
Come in!

26:51.184 --> 26:53.476
[SOMETHING HAPPENED WITH HAI CUONG]

26:59.184 --> 26:59.976
Phong! Ba!

27:01.351 --> 27:02.809
Wake up and go find some jobs!

27:16.101 --> 27:17.226
Got up yet?

27:21.393 --> 27:22.226
Awake yet?

27:23.388 --> 27:24.721
God damn it!

27:25.498 --> 27:26.598
I couldn't get any sleep last night...

27:26.623 --> 27:28.213
since the whole neighborhood
was quarreling rowdily!

27:28.768 --> 27:29.726
Please let me sleep.

27:29.809 --> 27:31.351
Ignore him.

27:31.934 --> 27:32.559
I'll hug to you sleep.

27:34.170 --> 27:36.659
Get up! Wake up!

27:36.684 --> 27:38.768
I'm awake!

27:38.809 --> 27:39.632
How about you?

27:39.667 --> 27:40.834
You're up?

27:41.226 --> 27:42.143
Yes…

27:45.518 --> 27:46.226
Guys, let's go!

27:46.893 --> 27:47.851
Why so slow?

27:48.893 --> 27:49.619
I'm coming.

27:53.893 --> 27:54.320
Long!

27:54.893 --> 27:55.394
What?

27:56.184 --> 27:57.015
Do you have any spare shirts?

27:58.768 --> 27:59.404
Wear it?

28:00.809 --> 28:01.422
Okay.

28:03.373 --> 28:05.042
Let's go! We must find a job today.

28:05.393 --> 28:05.810
Okay.

28:09.643 --> 28:10.120
Hey!

28:10.768 --> 28:11.618
What now?

28:13.601 --> 28:14.202
What?

28:22.309 --> 28:23.434
I know Chan.

28:24.393 --> 28:25.351
He won't let this slide.

28:30.855 --> 28:33.689
Just take time to rest, Big Brother.
Don't worry too much.

28:34.976 --> 28:35.893
We can handle this.

28:38.875 --> 28:39.664
Big Brother!

28:50.726 --> 28:51.435
Big Brother!

28:51.934 --> 28:53.493
Big Brother!

28:54.059 --> 28:54.678
Big Brother!

28:55.518 --> 28:56.934
Chan's gang is coming. Gotta run.

29:06.201 --> 29:06.701
Stop!

29:50.684 --> 29:51.784
Hey, who keeps the cigarette pack?

29:51.809 --> 29:52.268
I keep it.

29:52.393 --> 29:54.309
Give me, I'll give it back to him later.

29:54.351 --> 29:55.018
You keep, not me.

29:55.143 --> 29:55.768
Wait, I didn't keep it.

30:03.351 --> 30:03.963
Attack!

30:11.434 --> 30:12.934
Don't touch my bros.
